## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates practical RN native module design for media I/O, threading, and cross‑platform bridges, focusing on beginner accessibility with real-world constraints.

## Key Concepts

- Native module API design for RN (iOS/Android)
- Real-time PCM streaming via events
- WAV file assembly and disk I/O
